| **2. End-to-end thin slice** | One collected menu → raw object → BigQuery → one dbt model → one Streamlit table. Define grain and IDs. | **3–5 h** | Needs one successful source from phase 1. Establishes interfaces for later work. |
| **3. Durable ingestion and history** | Add small source coverage, timestamps, manifests, idempotent loads, explicit retries/rejects, and raw replay. Demonstrate a rerun without duplicates. | **5–9 h** | Depends on phase 2. Can overlap conceptually with UI and extraction work once schemas are fixed. |
